Description: GNOME Quick Setting for tablet-only finger touch
 Automatically block an internal finger touchscreen in laptop mode using
 an Intel Virtual Switches posture sensor. Pen and touchpad input remain
 independent. Includes a system service and GNOME Shell extension.
